Specifically, the residential-mortgage domain logic in `packs/rmbs_nl_green_lion.yaml`
(province and NUTS-3 distributions, EPC label mix, delinquency transition matrix,
prepayment and charge-off calibration, the 71-column ESMA Annex 2 layout) is a
declarative re-expression of the hardcoded Python in
`deeploans/synthetic-data-designer/data_designer_loan_book.py` and
`deeploans/synthetic-data-designer/age_to_panel.py`.

The generalised engine, spec format, profiler, and validation layers in `src/sdd/`
are original work.

The test fixture `tests/fixtures/cre_taxonomy.json` is the ESMA Annex 3
commercial-real-estate field taxonomy as extracted by the deeploans ETL
pipelines, with the long regulatory prose removed to keep the fixture small.
It is used to exercise the structure parser against genuine regulatory
metadata.
